      "character": "Silver",
      "audioFile": "werewolf_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/werewolf_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_02.mp3",
      "text": "You don't know me, Seven.",
      "duration": 1.579
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Seven",
      "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_werewolf_gigawatt_convo03_03.mp3",
      "text": "I know the clich\u00e9 you are all-to keen to wrap yourself in.  You're worse than a petulant teenager\u2026 at least they have the excuse that their brains aren't fully formed.",
      "duration": 10.887
    },
    {
